  "body": "Looking for a family home that truly works for a growing family or extended living? This brand-new, single-level 6-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home in the heart of Red Beach offers flexibility, comfort, and great potential all in one.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you’re welcomed by a sun-filled open-plan living and dining area, creating a warm and inviting space for everyday living and entertaining. The modern kitchen sits at the centre, featuring quality appliances, generous storage, and premium lead-free tapware throughout the home that meets the latest New Zealand standards, making it both practical and family-friendly.\r\n\r\nThe layout is thoughtfully designed to offer both privacy and flexibility. The master bedroom is set in its own private corner, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\nThree additional bedrooms are serviced by a well-appointed family bathroom, ideal for family living.\r\n\r\nA real bonus is the granny potential area, offering two bedrooms, a separate living area, its own bathroom, and a kitchenette with sink, along with its own private door. This flexible space is perfect for extended family, teenagers or guests. An extra separate toilet near the main living area adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nOther features include:\r\n• Full Bosch appliance\r\n• Central air conditioning for all-year comfort\r\n• Roof attic ladder with excellent storage potential\r\n• Additional roof ventilation system designed to help reduce summer heat\r\n• Premium James Hardie Linea weatherboard offering high durability, low maintenance, and superior fire resistance\r\n\r\nThe location is a standout, just a short drive to Red Beach and Orewa Beach, perfect for weekend walks, swimming, and enjoying the coastal lifestyle. You’re also close to local schools, parks, cafes, and Silverdale Shopping Centre, with easy motorway access making commuting simple and convenient.\r\n\r\nHomes offering space, flexibility, and location are rarely available, don’t miss this opportunity. Contact us today for your private viewing or attend our Open Home.",
